    - target: {fileID: 6805618455031429470, guid: da836dd4eb59886488d2763a187f6fb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "You\u2019ve always had this idea: what if\u2026 the wind\u2019s blow
        is what moves the boat? Sounds like magic. You\u2019ve been trying to make
        a durable material, and now you\u2019ve finally attached it to the raft.
        Maybe now you\u2019ll cross these waters."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
